{"text": "Too Much Sky.\n\nThe spaceship landed on a hot afternoon.\n\nNia stood up, and her legs felt like stone. Dr Ansel was right. Her small bag felt heavier than a big suitcase.\n\nThen the door opened, and she saw the sky.\n\nIt was not black. It was blue, and it was everywhere. It had no roof and no end.\n\nNia stopped at the door. Her heart was fast. She held Dad's hand hard.\n\n\"It's too big,\" she said quietly. \"Where does it stop?\"\n\n\"It doesn't,\" said Dad. \"That's the best part.\"\n\nNia didn't think so. She looked at the ground all the way to the car.\n\nLeo was taller than in his photos, and he laughed a lot.\n\nHis grandma, Edda, gave Nia a long, warm hug. She smelled of bread.\n\nThe farm was beautiful, but it was very dry. The fields were yellow and brown. The ground had long lines in it, like an old face.\n\n\"Forty days,\" said Grandma Edda. She looked up at the empty sky. \"Forty days and not one drop.\"\n\nNia looked up too, but only for a second. The sky was still too big for her.\n\nThe next morning, Leo showed Nia the farm.\n\nThere were long black pipes on the ground. They went between the plants like snakes. Every few metres, there was a small metal head on top. One of them went right past the house, under Nia's window.\n\n\"What are those?\" asked Nia.\n\n\"Our water pipes,\" said Leo happily. \"I built them with Grandma. At night, they throw water over the fields.\"\n\nLeo turned a red wheel near the house. Water jumped out of the little heads. It flew up and fell on the tomatoes.\n\nNia put her hand in it. The water was warm, like bath water.\n\n\"It's like rain!\" she said.\n\n\"Almost,\" said Leo. \"But real rain is better.\" He turned the wheel off. \"We have to save water. We only use them at night.\"\n\nThat evening, they watched the weather report on Grandma's old computer. There was a map with a big grey cloud on it.\n\n\"Rain is coming on Friday,\" said the weather report.\n\nLeo shouted. Grandma Edda laughed.\n\n\"Friday is in three days,\" said Leo. \"Perfect, Moon Girl!\"\n\nThat night, Nia sat at her window. Outside, the sky was full of stars. She looked up for one minute. Then for two minutes.\n\n\"Three more days,\" she said to the stars.", "textSha256": "0f7a35af589e2ba920cb7fe0903917f13f8b1048ebdd7da954747fe4769a93d6", "voice_id": "EXAVITQu4vr4xnSDxMaL", "model_id": "eleven_v3", "speed": 0.95, "lang": "en", "parts": 1, "alignment": {"characters": ["T", "o", "o", " ", "M", "u", "c", "h", " ", "S", "k", "y", ".", "\n", "\n", "T", "h", "e", " ", "s", "p", "a", "c", "e", "s", "h", "i", "p", " ", "l", "a", "n", "d", "e", "d", " ", "o", "n", " ", "a", " ", "h", "o", "t", " ", "a", "f", "t", "e", "r", "n", "o", "o", "n", ".", "\n", "\n", "N", "i", "a", " ", "s", "t", "o", "o", "d", " ", "u", "p", ",", " ", "a", "n", "d", " ", "h", "e", "r", " ", "l", "e", "g", "s", " ", "f", "e", "l", "t", " ", "l", "i", "k", "e", " ", "s", "t", "o", "n", "e", ".", " ", "D", "r", " ", "A", "n", "s", "e", "l", " ", "w", "a", "s", " ", "r", "i", "g", "h", "t", ".", " ", "H", "e", "r", " ", "s", "m", "a", "l", "l", " ", "b", "a", "g", " ", "f", "e", "l", "t", " ", "h", "e", "a", "v", "i", "e", "r", " ", "t", "h", "a", "n", " ", "a", " ", "b", "i", "g", " ", "s", "u", "i", "t", "c", "a", "s", "e", ".", "\n", "\n", "T", "h", "e", "n", " ", "t", "h", "e", " ", "d", "o", "o", "r", " ", "o", "p", "e", "n", "e", "d", ",", " ", "a", "n", "d", " ", "s", "h", "e", " ", "s", "a", "w", " ", "t", "h", "e", " ", "s", "k", "y", ".", "\n", "\n", "I", "t", " ", "w", "a", "s", " ", "n", "o", "t", " ", "b", "l", "a", "c", "k", ".", " ", "I", "t", " ", "w", "a", "s", " ", "b", "l", "u", "e", ",", " ", "a", "n", "d", " ", "i", "t", " ", "w", "a", "s", " ", "e", "v", "e", "r", "y", "w", "h", "e", "r", "e", ".", " ", "I", "t", " ", "h", "a", "d", " ", "n", "o", " ", "r", "o", "o", "f", " ", "a", "n", "d", " ", "n", "o", " ", "e", "n", "d", ".", "\n", "\n", "N", "i", "a", " ", "s", "t", "o", "p", "p", "e", "d", " ", "a", "t"